  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1681288",
  "reference": "Field, R.J. and Noyes, R.M. (1974). Oscillations in chemical systems. IV. Limit cycle behavior in a model of a real chemical reaction. Journal of Chemical Physics 60(5):1877-1884. doi:10.1063/1.1681288."
