  "reference": "Taylor BD, Miller D, Iseki H, Fink C. Nature and/or nurture? Analyzing the determinants of transit ridership across US urbanized areas. Transportation Research Part A. 2009;43(1):60-77. Empirical ridership study; no derivation of the local three-stock dynamical system or dollar-to-quality conversion is established.",
  "stocks": [
